<body><div class="bg-field" aria-hidden="true"><i class="blob b1"></i><i class="blob b2"></i><i class="blob b3"></i></div>
<header class="site"><div class="wrap"><nav><a class="brand" href="./" aria-label="formatjson — inicio"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="7" width="20" height="18" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"/><path d="M9 12h6M9 16h6M9 20h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="20" cy="14.5" r="2.2" fill="var(--accent)"/></svg><span>formatjson<small>.ru</small></span></a><button class="burger" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navlinks" aria-label="Menú"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path class="l1" d="M2 5h16"/><path class="l2" d="M2 10h16"/><path class="l3" d="M2 15h16"/></svg></button><div class="nav-links" id="navlinks"><a href="./" aria-current="page">Convertidor</a><a href="yaml/">YAML</a><a href="base64/">Base64</a><a href="guide/">Guía</a><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-left:6px;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:var(--card)"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 0 1 0 20A15 15 0 0 1 12 2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M4 6h16M4 18h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.6"/></svg><a href="../" style="color:var(--brand);font-weight:600;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none">RU</a><a href="../en/" style="color:var(--brand);font-weight:600;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none">EN</a><span style="color:var(--fg);font-weight:700;font-size:12px">ES</span></span><button id="ttheme" class="tbtn" type="button" aria-label="Tema oscuro" title="Tema oscuro">◐</button></div></nav></div></header>
<main class="wrap">
<section class="hero">
<p class="eyebrow">Convertidores Dev</p>
<h1>JSON, YAML, Base64 — en segundos</h1>
<p>Formateo y validación de JSON, minificación, orden de claves, conversión JSON ↔ YAML, Base64 y codificación URL. Sin backend, todo en el navegador. Copiar, descargar y compartir por enlace.</p>
</section>
<div class="answer" id="tldr"><b>Resumen:</b> pega JSON → “Formatear” (2/4 espacios) o “Minificar”. Error — mostramos la línea. Para YAML — “JSON → YAML” y viceversa. Para Base64 — codificación UTF-8. Historial local.</div>

<section class="calc" id="calc" aria-label="Convertidor JSON/YAML/Base64">
<div class="calc-layout">
<div class="calc-fields">
<label>Entrada <textarea id="inp" rows="10" placeholder='{"name":"Juan","age":30,"tags":["dev","json"]}' style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;resize:vertical;min-height:160px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg)"></textarea></label>
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">
<label style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Indentación <select id="indent" style="padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg)"><option value="2">2 espacios</option><option value="4">4 espacios</option><option value="tab">Tab</option></select></label>
<label style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)"><input id="sort" type="checkbox" /> Ordenar claves</label>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button class="btn" id="fmt">Formatear</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="mini">Minificar</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="validate">Validar</button>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button class="btn ghost" id="j2y">JSON → YAML</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="y2j">YAML → JSON</button>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button class="btn ghost" id="b64e">Base64 ↑</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="b64d">Base64 ↓</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="urlE">URL ↑</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="urlD">URL ↓</button>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button class="btn ghost" id="copyOut">Copiar</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="download">Descargar .json</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="clear">Limpiar</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="share">Compartir</button>
</div>
<p id="stats" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0">Pega JSON, YAML o Base64. Ejemplo: &#123;&quot;hello&quot;:&quot;mundo&quot;&#125;</p>
</div>
<aside class="calc-side" aria-live="polite">
<span class="result-label">Resultado</span>
<textarea id="out" rows="12" readonly placeholder="El resultado aparecerá aquí…" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;resize:vertical;min-height:220px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);white-space:pre;overflow:auto"></textarea>
<div id="err" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--danger);min-height:18px;margin-top:6px"></div>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Atajos: Ctrl+Enter — formatear, Ctrl+Shift+M — minificar.</p>
</aside>
</div>
</section>

<h2>Ejemplos</h2>
<table class="data"><caption>Qué hace el convertidor</caption><tr><th>Entrada</th><th>Acción</th><th>Salida</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>&#123;&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;b&quot;:2&#125;</code></td><td>Formatear 2</td><td>con sangría y saltos</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>&#123;&quot;z&quot;:1,&quot;a&quot;:2&#125;</code></td><td>Ordenar claves</td><td><code>&#123;&quot;a&quot;:2,&quot;z&quot;:1&#125;</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>&#123;&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Juan&quot;&#125;</code></td><td>JSON → YAML</td><td><code>name: Juan</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>hola mundo</code></td><td>Base64 ↑</td><td><code>aG9sYSBtdW5kbw==</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>hola mundo=1&amp;x=2</code></td><td>URL ↑</td><td><code>hola%20mundo%3D1%26x%3D2</code></td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Funciones</h2>
<div class="cards">
<a class="card" href="yaml/"><h3>Convertidor YAML</h3><p>JSON ↔ YAML con preservación de tipos y validación.</p></a>
